								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >The soil has grown stagnant and weak. The harvest is long overdue. You've come to collect it.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Touch it and it dies.</strong><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/db7290e4535fc633699f52fce280b9b7.poster.avif?t=1792745648" width=960 height=540 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/db7290e4535fc633699f52fce280b9b7.webm?t=1792745648" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/db7290e4535fc633699f52fce280b9b7.mp4?t=1792745648" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br> <br><strong>Upgrade your plagues.</strong><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/e5e94cb456dc7d4ca952c3b1f8d43cd0.poster.avif?t=1792745648" width=960 height=540 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/e5e94cb456dc7d4ca952c3b1f8d43cd0.webm?t=1792745648" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/e5e94cb456dc7d4ca952c3b1f8d43cd0.mp4?t=1792745648" type="video/mp4"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>Spread faster, reach wider.</strong><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/ac0d21b52635ea541ce02719679d91ab.poster.avif?t=1792745648" width=960 height=540 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/ac0d21b52635ea541ce02719679d91ab.webm?t=1792745648" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/ac0d21b52635ea541ce02719679d91ab.mp4?t=1792745648" type="video/mp4"></video></span><strong></strong><br>  <br><strong>The land fades, and so does everything on it.</strong><br>  <span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/51a6a2b58cde123880132d1a6edcfaae.poster.avif?t=1792745648" width=960 height=540 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/51a6a2b58cde123880132d1a6edcfaae.webm?t=1792745648" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138990/extras/51a6a2b58cde123880132d1a6edcfaae.mp4?t=1792745648" type="video/mp4"></video></span> <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A beautiful, relaxing soundtrack and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Multiple unique environments to wither, beyond wheat fields</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Numerous plague upgrades for spreading, speed and reach</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A mysterious story told through the world around you</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A world that visibly and audibly changes as you play</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
